# 🤖 Project Rules for Cursor AI Agent

## 1. Framework & Performance Rules
- Stack: React (Vite, JS), Tailwind CSS, React Router v6, Supabase, react-ga4
- State Management: MUST use `react-hook-form` with Uncontrolled Components to prevent full-page re-renders on every keystroke.
- Do NOT use `useState` for binding text inputs/textareas.

## 2. Design System & UI Rules (Tally Style)
- Replicate Tally.so style: minimal, document-like, centered container (`max-w-2xl mx-auto`).
- Top Accent Bar: `h-1.5 bg-violet-600` at the very top of the page.
- Primary Accent: Purple/Violet (`violet-600`).
- Card UI for notice: `bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-5`.

## 3. Mobile Optimization (Mandatory)
- Font size for ALL `<input>` and `<textarea>` MUST be at least `16px` (`text-base`) to prevent iOS auto-zoom on focus.
- Touch target sizes for buttons must be at least `44px x 44px`.
- Use `viewport-fit=cover` and iOS Safe Area insets (`env(safe-area-inset-bottom)`).

## 4. Security & Privacy Rules (OWASP Standard)
- RLS Policy: Only `INSERT` is allowed for public/anon key. Never expose `SELECT` permissions to public.
- GA4 Analytics: Absolute ZERO PII (Personally Identifiable Information like name, phone, email, text response) sending to GA4. Only send non-identifiable events (`position_selected`, `step_completed`).

## 5. Output Behavior
- Provide 100% full production-ready code without placeholder comments like `// ... existing code ...`.